ry no value."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Check the network shown inside your wallet before every signature — a wallet can be connected to a different chain than you expect."}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Reference the exact values on our ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs#network-reference","children":"network reference"}]," page and confirm them against your wallet's view of the chain."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"post-sec","id":"token-details","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"no","children":"03"}],"Check name, symbol, supply and decimals"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"These values are written into the contract at deployment and cannot be changed afterwards. Verify each one on the configuration screen as if it were final — because it is."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Name and symbol."}]," No typos, no order errors — the ticker and name are what wallets and explorers will show."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Total supply."}]," Confirm the exact number and digits you intend to mint."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Decimals."}]," 18 is the BEP-20 default and the most compatible choice."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["For guidance on how these choices interact, see ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/bep20-tokenomics","children":"BEP-20 tokenomics"}]," before you finalize them."]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"post-sec","id":"minting","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children"