10:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Mintable."}]," If enabled, more supply can be created at any time by the owner. Ask: who is the owner, and what happens to that authority later?"]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Burnable."}]," If enabled, supply can be permanently removed by the owner. Burns are one-way, so any burn plan should be deliberate."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Pausable."}]," Transfers can be halted by the owner. Consider what it means if a pause is ever triggered unexpectedly."]}]]}]]}]
