12:["$","section",null,{"className":"post-sec","id":"ownership","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"no","children":"05"}],"Ownership: keep, transfer or renounce"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The deploying wallet is the owner by default and controls every enabled feature. Decide what happens to that role before launch, and state it out loud."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Keep."}]," The owner keeps full control of enabled functions. Simple, but the authority stays centralized in one wallet."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Transfer."}]," Ownership moves to another address — useful if operations and the deploying wallet are separate."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Renounce."}]," The owner role is given up. See the next section for what renouncing does and does not mean."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Ownership is a feature you can review in the builder. The precise mechanics are documented in our ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/docs#ownership","children":"ownership documentation"}],"."]}]]}]
13:["$","section",null,{"className":"post-sec","id":"limits","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"no","children":"06"}],"Max Transaction and Max Wallet settings"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"These limits cap how much a transaction can move and how much one wallet can hold, expressed as a share of total supply."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Max Transaction."}]," A cap per transfer. Good for pacing, but remember it also applies to your own distribution moves."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Max Wallet."}]," A cap per wallet balance. Holders who need to receive or move large amounts will hit it."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Pick percentages that match how the tokens will actually move. There is no universal value — a limit that fits one distribution plan can break another."}]]}]
14:["$","section",null,{"className":"post-sec","id":"lists","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"no","children":"07"}],"Blacklist and Whitelist trade-offs"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"List-based features give the owner live control over addresses that can use the token. That flexibility is also centralization."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Blacklist."}]," The owner can add addresses that can no longer transfer. It's a moderation tool with a compliance cost — and it's owner-dependent."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Whitelist."}]," The owner can restrict transfers to approved addresses. Useful for gated launches, fully at the owner's discretion."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Whichever you choose, recognize that ",["$","b",null,{"children":"the owner can change the lists"}],". That is the point, and it is also the trade-off. The ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/features#access-controls","children":"access controls"}]," section describes both options."]}]]}]
15:["$","section",null,{"className":"post-sec","id":"wallet-security","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"no","children":"08"}],"Wallet security before you sign"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The most security-sensitive asset in the entire process is your wallet's private key. No contract setting protects it."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Keep your seed phrase offline and private. Nobody — including BNB Token Maker support — will ever ask for it."}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Deploy from a dedicated wallet you fully control, not one you share or access casually."}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Confirm every request your wallet shows you before signing — network, recipient, amount and fee."}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["For wallet-facing steps after launch, our ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/add-bep20-token-to-wallet","children":"add a BEP-20 token to your wallet"}]," guide covers the display side without ever touching keys."]}]]}]
16:["$","section",null,{"className":"post-sec","id":"final-review","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"no","children":"09"}],"Final review: fees and the signing step"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Deployment asks for two separate costs, and both must be clear to you before anything is signed:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Platform fee."}]," Shown in the create flow in BNB before you connect your wallet. Always review it on your own screen."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"className":"fa-solid fa-circle-check","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Network gas."}]," Set by BNB Smart Chain, paid in BNB. Your wallet displays the exact gas before you confirm."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Break down both values before you start in our ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/bep20-token-cost","children":"BEP-20 token cost guide"}],". When the wallet prompt appears, check the network (Chain ID 56), the fee and the contract details one final time."]}]]}]
